-2026-rules/10845727/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-d33fda3ab5f1e2ca3df9b501c3b7b1b341caefd603323c270a9c3ca3050d2e68","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"F1 2026赛季中期评分：Racing Bulls惊艳中游集团","summaryZh":"Racing Bulls在2025年追平了队史最佳的第六名成绩，但新赛季开始前仍面临诸多疑问。作为F1的小型车队，巨大的规则变化是一次重大压力测试，而其与对手激烈争夺第六名的过程，导致其2026年赛车的研发启动时间晚于多个直接竞争对手。此外，其全新动力单元的开发也存在巨大不确定性。然而，在2026赛季中期，Racing Bulls的表现令人惊艳，在中游集团中脱颖而出。","publishedAt":"2026-08-14T10:24:47.033Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-12T11:09:17.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-6.motorsport.com/images/amp/0qgKeJQY/s6/team-report-card-racing-bulls.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":369783,"altZh":"F1 2026赛季中期评分：Racing Bulls惊艳中游集团"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/f1-2026-mid-season-grades-racing-bulls-stuns-midfield-pack-/10845309/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-45db6382cd85545c978d87b3d0342df65d8a734c4c9fc6ece2f464a0f46b196a","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"杰西卡·霍金斯：女性具备F1所需体能，但初级系列赛需调整","summaryZh":"阿斯顿·马丁F1车队大使杰西卡·霍金斯表示，女性拥有参加F1所需的体能，但建议在F2和F3等初级赛事中进行调整，以确保男女车手能公平竞争。她在Road to Success播客中回顾了2023年在匈牙利测试AMR21的经历。","publishedAt":"2026-08-14T10:24:47.033Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-12T09:05:02.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-3.motorsport.com/images/amp/YXRApBx0/s6/jessica-hawkins-development-dr.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":184358,"altZ